+    // Font-atlas shader. Normal ImGui/UI pixels retain the upstream path.
+    // Vesta ESP glyph blocks are tagged with B=0/A=1 and store foreground
+    // coverage in R plus the precomputed cardinal outline coverage in G.
+    {
